 {
  "slug": "sunscreen-amount-guide",
  "section": "tutorial",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/sunscreen-amount-guide\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"tutorial\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583209814683-c023dd293cc6?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">防曬教學</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">防曬到底要搽幾多？韓國皮膚科的「兩指法則」</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">大部分人的防曬用量都不夠。韓國皮膚科醫生提出的「兩指法則」，教你用最簡單的方式量度正確的防曬用量，確保足夠的紫外線防護力。</p>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 3 月 1 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    4 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "seasonal-skincare-transition",
  "section": "tutorial",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/seasonal-skincare-transition\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"tutorial\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570172619644-dfd03ed5d881?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">換季護膚</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">春季護膚轉換指南：從厚重到輕盈的三步過渡法</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">換季時肌膚最容易出狀況。不要一次過換掉所有產品，用「三步過渡法」循序漸進地調整護膚程序，讓肌膚平穩度過季節轉換期。</p>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 2 月 20 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    6 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "cica-centella-guide",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/cica-centella-guide\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570172619644-dfd03ed5d881?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">明星成分</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">CICA 積雪草全解析：為什麼韓國品牌都在用？</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">積雪草（Centella Asiatica）被稱為韓國國民修護成分，從 Dr.Jart+ 到 SKIN1004 都以它為主打。深入了解積雪草的四大活性成分及其修護原理。</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">Centella Asiatica</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 3 月 30 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    7 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "peptides-guide",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/peptides-guide\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620916566398-39f1143ab7be?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">趨勢成分</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">2026 年最熱門成分：多肽（Peptides）為什麼突然爆紅？</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">多肽在韓國護膚品市場的搜尋量按年增長 320%。從銅肽到信號肽，了解不同類型的多肽各自有什麼功效，以及哪些韓國產品值得嘗試。</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">Peptides</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 3 月 22 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    8 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "niacinamide-guide",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/niacinamide-guide\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598440947619-2c35fc9aa908?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">經典成分</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">菸鹼醯胺（Niacinamide）：被低估的全能美白成分</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">菸鹼醯胺不只能美白，還能控油、縮毛孔、強化屏障。了解為什麼韓國皮膚科醫生稱它為「最值得長期使用」的護膚成分之一。</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">Niacinamide</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 3 月 14 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    6 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "probiotics-skincare",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/probiotics-skincare\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616394584738-fc6e612e71b9?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">趨勢成分</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">益生菌護膚：你的皮膚微生態為什麼很重要？</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">皮膚表面住著數以億計的微生物，它們與肌膚健康息息相關。韓國品牌率先將益生菌（Probiotics）和後生元（Postbiotics）應用到護膚品中的科學原理。</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">Probiotics</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 3 月 6 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    7 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "hyaluronic-vs-pga",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/hyaluronic-vs-pga\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573461160327-b450ce3d8e7f?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">成分比較</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">玻尿酸 vs 聚麩胺酸：哪個保濕成分更適合你？</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">玻尿酸（HA）是保濕界的王者，但近年「下一代保濕成分」聚麩胺酸（PGA）的保水力據說高出 5 倍。兩者的分子結構和適用膚質有什麼不同？</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">HA vs PGA</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 2 月 28 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    6 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 },
 {
  "slug": "retinol-guide",
  "section": "ingredient",
  "html": "<a href=\"/articles/retinol-guide\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;display:block;height:100%;\">\n            <article class=\"column-card\" data-category=\"ingredient\">\n              <div class=\"column-card__image-wrap\">\n                <img class=\"column-card__image\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512496015851-a90fb38ba796?w=600&q=80\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"column-card__body\">\n                <span class=\"column-card__tag\">成分科普</span>\n                <h3 class=\"column-card__title\">視黃醇入門指南：韓國品牌如何讓 A 醇變得溫和？</h3>\n                <p class=\"column-card__excerpt\">視黃醇（Retinol）功效強大但容易刺激，韓國品牌透過包裹技術和複合配方降低刺激性。了解如何選擇適合自己的 A 醇產品和正確的使用方法。</p>\n                <span class=\"column-card__ingredient-tag\">Retinol</span>\n                <div class=\"column-card__meta\">\n                  <span>2026 年 2 月 15 日</span>\n                  <span class=\"column-card__read-time\">\n                    <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg>\n                    8 分鐘\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </article>\n            </a>"
 }
